WEBVTT

00:00:01.074 --> 00:00:05.944
Yume kara samete mo
Even if I wake from my dreams

00:00:06.984 --> 00:00:12.314
Kono te wo nobasu yo
I'll reach my hand out to you

00:00:23.964 --> 00:00:29.304
Onaji tsuyosa de yobi au
If our hearts can reach each other

00:00:30.034 --> 00:00:34.664
Kokoro ni nareru no naraba
with the same strength

00:00:35.904 --> 00:00:41.174
Nanninbun no kizu demo
Then I would be able to bare

00:00:41.714 --> 00:00:46.844
Boku wa uketome rareru yo
The pain of many hearts

00:00:47.254 --> 00:00:50.784
Mousukoshi datte kiga surun da
I can feel that it will arrive soon

00:00:50.854 --> 00:00:55.954
Kono kabe ga kuzureru
When these walls will be torn down

00:00:56.594 --> 00:01:01.094
Reimei
The dawn

00:01:02.664 --> 00:01:08.634
Yume kara samete mo
mada minai yume no houmade
Even if we wake from our dreams
We'll have to keep running

00:01:08.704 --> 00:01:14.614
Bokura wa hitori de
hashiri tsuzukeru shika nain da
Towards our unrevealed dreams

00:01:14.684 --> 00:01:21.244
Korogari mayotte tsukuri dasu
boku no inryoku ga
The gravity by my painful journey
will draw me

00:01:21.524 --> 00:01:27.464
Itsuka kimi e
To you one day

00:02:07.234 --> 00:02:08.964
It's frustrating, isn't it?

00:02:09.264 --> 00:02:10.704
Frustrating?

00:02:10.774 --> 00:02:13.744
I think Haseo is doing his best.

00:02:14.104 --> 00:02:16.404
Yeah. I know he is.

00:02:17.944 --> 00:02:21.034
And still I can't do anything.

00:02:22.314 --> 00:02:24.974
I don't even know how he's doing.

00:02:25.114 --> 00:02:27.744
You can at least ask him
how he's doing.

00:02:27.824 --> 00:02:28.944
Don't you know?

00:02:29.024 --> 00:02:30.014
What?

00:02:30.124 --> 00:02:33.884
You can't even use short messages
in the Forest of Pain.

00:02:33.964 --> 00:02:35.294
Is that right?

00:02:35.364 --> 00:02:36.324
Yup.

00:02:36.594 --> 00:02:38.724
You can use it
once you're inside...

00:02:38.794 --> 00:02:40.094
...but not from the outside.

00:02:40.164 --> 00:02:43.604
- How could that be?
- It's strange, isn't it?

00:02:43.704 --> 00:02:47.804
That's why everyone's saying
this event is not normal.

00:02:47.874 --> 00:02:49.174
Yes, but...

00:02:49.244 --> 00:02:52.544
...once you're inside the forest
you can make contact, right?

00:02:55.814 --> 00:03:00.014
If I go in there,
I'll just get in the way.

00:03:00.884 --> 00:03:02.114
You think?

00:03:02.354 --> 00:03:06.054
I'd like to go and ask him
how he's doing.

00:03:06.124 --> 00:03:09.454
I'd like to go and see
if I can help out.

00:03:10.434 --> 00:03:11.894
But...

00:03:12.934 --> 00:03:15.424
...Haseo won't like that.

00:03:15.504 --> 00:03:16.734
I see.

00:03:18.404 --> 00:03:19.994
That is frustrating.

00:03:20.104 --> 00:03:21.334
Just...

00:03:22.874 --> 00:03:24.674
...three more hours.

00:03:24.844 --> 00:03:27.744
It looks like it's going
to be a long three hours.

00:03:56.004 --> 00:03:57.574
Wilted leaves muddy the earth

00:03:57.574 --> 00:04:00.214
Wilted leaves muddy the earth
I don't have time to deal
with small fry.

00:04:00.214 --> 00:04:00.244
Wilted leaves muddy the earth

00:04:00.244 --> 00:04:03.614
Wilted leaves muddy the earth
I have to get to the deepest part
within the time limit.

00:04:03.614 --> 00:04:04.414
Wilted leaves muddy the earth

00:04:04.414 --> 00:04:06.354
Wilted leaves muddy the earth
There's no end to this.

00:04:06.354 --> 00:04:06.684
Wilted leaves muddy the earth

00:04:06.684 --> 00:04:08.554
Wilted leaves muddy the earth
Get out of my way!

00:04:08.554 --> 00:04:13.784
Wilted leaves muddy the earth

00:04:14.594 --> 00:04:19.594
Hiding the never ending footprints

00:04:19.594 --> 00:04:20.264
Hiding the never ending footprints
I will get stronger.
For sure.

00:04:20.264 --> 00:04:22.294
I will get stronger.
For sure.

00:04:24.304 --> 00:04:25.794
I will get stronger!

00:04:35.944 --> 00:04:40.144
Their moves are simple,
but I'll be dead with a single hit.

00:04:41.354 --> 00:04:43.514
Anyway, I lost Taihaku.

00:04:43.594 --> 00:04:45.284
I wonder what I should do.

00:04:45.994 --> 00:04:47.254
What's the situation?

00:04:47.394 --> 00:04:48.384
Huh?

00:04:48.464 --> 00:04:50.824
How come you can email me
from the outside?

00:04:51.134 --> 00:04:53.534
I'm the one who has questions.

00:04:53.604 --> 00:04:56.434
You're not with Haseo, are you?

00:04:56.504 --> 00:04:58.834
Is that why you came into the forest?

00:04:59.234 --> 00:05:00.464
What's going on?

00:05:03.844 --> 00:05:05.404
I don't know.

00:05:06.044 --> 00:05:07.634
I can't move.

00:05:07.714 --> 00:05:10.044
I'm starting to think about quitting.

00:05:11.554 --> 00:05:13.074
Don't be stupid!

00:05:13.724 --> 00:05:18.244
Don't you think this is as useless as putting
an unopened can of food in the fridge?

00:05:18.324 --> 00:05:22.094
Anyway, keep some distance
and continue watching Haseo.

00:05:22.464 --> 00:05:25.624
But it's difficult keeping up with him...

00:05:26.034 --> 00:05:26.994
Huh?

00:05:27.064 --> 00:05:29.434
She just says what she needs to
and leaves the forest?

00:05:29.504 --> 00:05:35.704
I'm happy I know no song

00:05:35.774 --> 00:05:41.904
That will wake you from your sleep

00:05:41.984 --> 00:05:48.474
It's better that people forget

00:05:48.554 --> 00:05:56.794
They live with death

00:06:21.524 --> 00:06:23.484
Is this the end?

00:06:34.904 --> 00:06:36.164
Are you here?

00:06:36.434 --> 00:06:37.364
Yeah.

00:06:37.434 --> 00:06:38.304
I'm here.

00:06:38.374 --> 00:06:40.334
I was studying for school tomorrow.

00:06:40.444 --> 00:06:42.634
There're still two hours left.

00:06:42.704 --> 00:06:45.144
You can take a break, you know.

00:06:45.214 --> 00:06:46.904
But what about you?

00:06:46.984 --> 00:06:49.604
I'm always here like this.

00:06:50.314 --> 00:06:52.584
I always thought it was odd but...

00:06:52.654 --> 00:06:56.674
...do you just stare at your monitor
until someone talks to you?

00:06:58.454 --> 00:06:59.554
Of course not!

00:06:59.624 --> 00:07:02.064
I read books and play with my dog.

00:07:02.124 --> 00:07:03.454
You have a dog too?!

00:07:03.534 --> 00:07:05.764
Do you know what a Schnauzer is?

00:07:05.834 --> 00:07:08.024
Yeah! The bearded dog!

00:07:08.364 --> 00:07:10.704
He just turned 12.

00:07:10.804 --> 00:07:13.504
In human years, he's about 63.

00:07:13.574 --> 00:07:15.634
He's an old man like me.

00:07:15.704 --> 00:07:18.764
What? You don't seem that way.

00:07:18.844 --> 00:07:21.474
I mean, doesn't your wife
get mad at you...

00:07:21.544 --> 00:07:23.274
...for always being
logged in the game?

00:07:23.354 --> 00:07:25.844
It's just the cats and the dog now.

00:07:27.454 --> 00:07:28.514
I see.

00:07:28.584 --> 00:07:30.784
I hope I wasn't prying.

00:07:30.854 --> 00:07:32.114
Don't worry about it.

00:07:32.194 --> 00:07:33.214
Okay.

00:07:33.294 --> 00:07:36.284
I'm gonna go read the forum now.

00:08:05.394 --> 00:08:08.754
I will ask you a question.

00:08:10.494 --> 00:08:14.194
Is my daughter safe and sound?

00:08:18.504 --> 00:08:20.094
Answer me.

00:08:24.044 --> 00:08:27.844
I'm sorry, but I don't know
your daughter.

00:08:27.914 --> 00:08:31.874
But I hope and wish that she is well.

00:08:37.824 --> 00:08:41.724
I shall bequeath that sword to you.

00:09:13.324 --> 00:09:15.854
I thought you quit?

00:09:15.924 --> 00:09:16.894
Says who?

00:09:16.964 --> 00:09:18.324
Well...

00:09:19.034 --> 00:09:22.434
Well, that's okay.
Because I'm quitting.

00:09:22.804 --> 00:09:24.204
Makes no difference.

00:09:24.274 --> 00:09:25.734
I'm wasting time.

00:09:25.804 --> 00:09:29.174
If you're quitting then
leave me alone and get going.

00:09:29.274 --> 00:09:30.604
You can have these.

00:09:30.944 --> 00:09:33.574
Recovery medicine and stuff.
You need them, right?

00:09:33.644 --> 00:09:36.014
I don't need them since I'm quitting.

00:09:36.314 --> 00:09:37.614
Don't expect any thanks.

00:09:37.684 --> 00:09:38.444
Fine.

00:09:38.514 --> 00:09:39.844
One thing...

00:09:40.124 --> 00:09:44.284
My member address comes
with this gift.

00:09:44.594 --> 00:09:47.684
Kinda like an advertising banner
on a free server.

00:09:47.794 --> 00:09:49.484
Now you're annoying me.

00:09:50.264 --> 00:09:53.464
Anyway, the monsters'
special attacks are tough.

00:09:53.534 --> 00:09:56.994
You should avoid
any unnecessary fighting.

00:09:57.534 --> 00:09:59.164
That's none of your business!

00:10:02.544 --> 00:10:06.004
He's like sizzling water
on a hot grill.

00:10:06.144 --> 00:10:09.084
Can he clear it before he evaporates?

00:10:10.214 --> 00:10:12.444
That was an awesome metaphor!

00:10:14.724 --> 00:10:15.654
Hey!

00:10:15.724 --> 00:10:17.984
Someone's cleared the Forest of Pain!

00:10:18.794 --> 00:10:20.914
Taihaku of Icolo has cleared it!

00:10:26.094 --> 00:10:27.964
Avoid fighting?

00:10:28.034 --> 00:10:29.364
Is she stupid?

00:10:29.434 --> 00:10:31.734
These guys won't let me get by!

00:10:55.064 --> 00:10:58.694
I can't believe you actually quit.

00:10:58.764 --> 00:11:00.324
Let's go some place else.

00:11:04.134 --> 00:11:06.164
Explain what this is about.

00:11:06.234 --> 00:11:08.404
Who exactly are you?

00:11:08.474 --> 00:11:10.274
I don't understand.

00:11:10.344 --> 00:11:13.874
Your appearance
and speech are different...

00:11:13.944 --> 00:11:15.814
...but you're Ender, right?

00:11:15.884 --> 00:11:17.114
What are you talking about?

00:11:17.184 --> 00:11:19.314
You're good at role-playing.

00:11:19.384 --> 00:11:23.214
But which is your true character:
Ender or Pi?

00:11:25.024 --> 00:11:28.324
Naobi's around here using
a different name too, right?

00:11:28.894 --> 00:11:32.094
TaN grew to a huge guild
and it was simply disbanded.

00:11:32.164 --> 00:11:34.494
But you haven't lost your place.

00:11:35.004 --> 00:11:36.334
Isn't that weird?

00:11:36.404 --> 00:11:39.164
Well, you got that character
out of it, didn't you?

00:11:39.234 --> 00:11:40.964
Well, yeah.

00:11:42.774 --> 00:11:45.764
How did you
know I wasn't with him?

00:11:48.644 --> 00:11:51.814
Haseo had quit...

00:11:51.884 --> 00:11:54.314
...but I was still in the forest.

00:11:54.384 --> 00:11:56.284
Then, you decided
to come into the forest.

00:11:56.354 --> 00:11:59.814
That's why I guessed
Haseo had quit.

00:11:59.994 --> 00:12:02.184
But he was still there, you know.

00:12:02.264 --> 00:12:05.824
You didn't follow instructions.
Who do you think you are?

00:12:05.934 --> 00:12:07.624
I've had enough of this.

00:12:09.434 --> 00:12:11.734
There's something
suspicious about you.

00:12:11.804 --> 00:12:12.964
I don't like it.

00:12:13.034 --> 00:12:14.264
I'm not doing this anymore.

00:12:14.344 --> 00:12:15.434
I won't-

00:12:15.504 --> 00:12:16.734
Forgive me for it?

00:12:16.804 --> 00:12:18.804
Fine. Do what you want.

00:12:18.874 --> 00:12:22.004
As long as it doesn't
stir up a hornet's nest.

00:12:22.414 --> 00:12:24.504
You don't understand anything!

00:12:24.784 --> 00:12:27.544
Then explain it to me
if I don't understand!

00:12:27.724 --> 00:12:30.514
I'm already dealing with enough
of that kind of crap...

00:12:30.594 --> 00:12:32.644
...in the real world!

00:12:38.794 --> 00:12:40.564
Taihaku of Icolo?

00:12:40.804 --> 00:12:43.704
Well, I kind of know him.

00:12:43.974 --> 00:12:45.764
Yeah, there's no mistake.

00:12:45.834 --> 00:12:48.934
I heard it in town
and I checked it in the forum.

00:12:49.044 --> 00:12:50.164
He's the one...

00:12:50.774 --> 00:12:52.244
That cleared it?

00:12:52.314 --> 00:12:53.074
Yeah.

00:12:53.144 --> 00:12:54.304
What's he like?

00:12:54.884 --> 00:12:58.334
Icolo is a group that
values individual strength.

00:12:58.414 --> 00:13:00.354
There are only four members.

00:13:00.424 --> 00:13:02.654
And Taihaku's at the top
of the group.

00:13:03.184 --> 00:13:05.884
He must be very strong then.

00:13:07.794 --> 00:13:10.054
I wonder if Haseo's okay.

00:13:10.124 --> 00:13:11.024
Tabby.

00:13:11.094 --> 00:13:12.024
Huh?

00:13:12.094 --> 00:13:14.124
Let's be patient for now.

00:13:14.534 --> 00:13:17.054
Hard work doesn't always
get rewarded.

00:13:18.234 --> 00:13:20.564
That's normal in life.

00:13:20.874 --> 00:13:25.434
The belief that you're always rewarded
for hard work is just a fairy tale.

00:13:26.544 --> 00:13:28.704
Even so, Haseo is doing his best.

00:13:29.014 --> 00:13:31.884
He's probably all by himself
in the forest.

00:13:33.214 --> 00:13:36.154
Therefore, all we can do is wait.

00:13:39.224 --> 00:13:41.124
No matter what the outcome...

00:13:41.194 --> 00:13:44.634
...Haseo doesn't want to regret
not having tried his best.

00:13:44.694 --> 00:13:47.594
That's why he's fighting
alone in the forest.

00:13:47.834 --> 00:13:49.594
Don't anticipate a good outcome.

00:13:52.304 --> 00:13:55.064
That will come about, one way
or the other.

00:13:57.574 --> 00:13:59.134
Believe in Haseo.

00:14:02.844 --> 00:14:04.814
I'm going out for a bit.

00:14:45.494 --> 00:14:46.954
What the hell is this?

00:14:47.094 --> 00:14:49.564
I didn't come all the way here
to get a weapon!

00:14:57.004 --> 00:14:58.094
Master Yata?

00:15:04.874 --> 00:15:06.104
He disappeared?

00:15:06.174 --> 00:15:08.514
That's impossible!

00:15:08.844 --> 00:15:10.284
Interesting.

00:15:10.884 --> 00:15:13.684
Impossible things happen...

00:15:14.484 --> 00:15:17.384
That's the way it is here
in The World.

00:15:26.464 --> 00:15:29.664
I will ask you a question.

00:15:30.404 --> 00:15:33.964
Is my daughter safe and sound?

00:15:34.044 --> 00:15:35.564
What are you talking about?

00:15:36.074 --> 00:15:37.564
Answer me.

00:15:37.644 --> 00:15:38.804
How should I know?

00:15:38.874 --> 00:15:40.314
Who are you?!

00:15:41.144 --> 00:15:42.914
Who's your daughter?!

00:15:47.324 --> 00:15:51.514
I shall not bequeath those
swords to you.

00:16:24.024 --> 00:16:29.464
I'm surprised it was so hard,
even with Taihaku of Icolo.

00:16:29.694 --> 00:16:30.994
What kind of man is he?

00:16:31.064 --> 00:16:31.924
Huh?

00:16:31.994 --> 00:16:36.024
It took me a while to realize
you are the Phyllo from that time.

00:16:36.404 --> 00:16:39.534
We're acquainted in such
a minimal way.

00:16:39.874 --> 00:16:44.034
Nevertheless, you, who many call
the "Mac Anu ornament"...

00:16:44.114 --> 00:16:46.844
...came all the way here.

00:16:47.314 --> 00:16:50.574
There must be someone in the forest
you are concerned about.

00:16:50.654 --> 00:16:51.774
That's right.

00:16:54.154 --> 00:16:56.214
I won't push the question.

00:16:56.324 --> 00:16:58.384
I hope for a safe return.

00:16:58.454 --> 00:17:02.584
I don't care if he's all beat up
and quits right away.

00:17:04.034 --> 00:17:05.994
That's how I feel.

00:17:06.094 --> 00:17:07.394
All right...

00:17:08.304 --> 00:17:09.264
Wait!

00:17:09.434 --> 00:17:10.454
Huh?

00:17:10.934 --> 00:17:13.134
I just explained
the harshness of the forest.

00:17:14.344 --> 00:17:18.144
Knowing how severe it is,
how can you be so heartless?

00:17:18.214 --> 00:17:21.144
He fights alone in the
forest and you...

00:17:21.214 --> 00:17:22.274
Or is it "she"?

00:17:22.344 --> 00:17:23.614
He's a boy.

00:17:23.684 --> 00:17:28.014
It doesn't seem right to be
so dismissive of that boy's efforts.

00:17:28.184 --> 00:17:32.314
What awaits him
once he clears the forest...

00:17:35.064 --> 00:17:37.024
...is something much worse.

00:17:37.364 --> 00:17:38.484
I don't know.

00:17:38.994 --> 00:17:41.724
I don't know, but if
that's the path he chose...

00:17:41.804 --> 00:17:44.564
...then no one has the right
to say anything about it.

00:17:44.634 --> 00:17:46.574
A game is a game.

00:17:46.674 --> 00:17:49.074
The net works just like reality.

00:17:49.144 --> 00:17:53.544
Even so, it just doesn't seem right
to link the two together.

00:17:54.044 --> 00:17:56.014
Is that what this is all about?

00:17:56.214 --> 00:17:57.374
That's right.

00:17:58.484 --> 00:18:01.184
It's not an issue
I can figure out easily.

00:18:24.514 --> 00:18:27.274
Was the sword you obtained...

00:18:28.344 --> 00:18:30.944
...worth the hardship
in the forest?

00:18:37.324 --> 00:18:39.454
I'm sorry.
I must be a bother.

00:18:58.244 --> 00:19:00.004
May I join you?

00:19:00.074 --> 00:19:01.044
Huh?

00:19:03.714 --> 00:19:04.584
Hi.

00:19:04.654 --> 00:19:06.044
Why are you here?

00:19:06.114 --> 00:19:08.984
You were really worried
about Haseo...

00:19:09.054 --> 00:19:11.024
...so I thought you'd be here.

00:19:11.154 --> 00:19:12.244
I see.

00:19:12.394 --> 00:19:14.454
Is he still in the forest?

00:19:16.064 --> 00:19:17.024
Yeah.

00:19:17.124 --> 00:19:20.794
I want to congratulate him
when he gets back.

00:19:21.134 --> 00:19:23.764
I can at least do that.

00:19:24.474 --> 00:19:28.094
And so I'm just waiting here.
That's all.

00:19:28.204 --> 00:19:30.334
Haseo must be very lucky...

00:19:32.744 --> 00:19:34.674
...to have such a wonderful friend.

00:19:34.744 --> 00:19:36.684
I don't know about that.

00:19:36.744 --> 00:19:40.344
Haseo doesn't think of me
as a friend.

00:19:40.514 --> 00:19:41.784
Is that so?

00:19:41.854 --> 00:19:44.724
He thinks I'm annoying.

00:19:45.324 --> 00:19:47.724
Then why do you still support him?

00:19:55.164 --> 00:19:56.364
That's it.

00:19:56.904 --> 00:20:00.334
I think I finally know what
I want to do.

00:20:01.774 --> 00:20:04.404
I think I know what I can do.

00:20:04.514 --> 00:20:06.134
It's just a feeling, though.

00:20:07.044 --> 00:20:12.074
This area will be closed upon
completion of the event.

00:20:12.784 --> 00:20:13.944
He's still gone?

00:20:14.014 --> 00:20:16.544
He's definitely still in the game.

00:20:16.654 --> 00:20:18.644
But I cannot pinpoint his location.

00:20:19.354 --> 00:20:20.724
It doesn't matter.

00:20:20.794 --> 00:20:23.314
Once the event is over,
we'll find out.

00:20:23.894 --> 00:20:27.764
This area will be terminated upon
completion of the event.

00:20:28.434 --> 00:20:30.864
Users who are in this area...

00:20:30.934 --> 00:20:35.234
...immediately take
the nearest platform to town.

00:20:35.674 --> 00:20:38.004
Three minutes to area termination.

00:20:38.074 --> 00:20:39.514
Haseo.

00:20:39.974 --> 00:20:40.874
Don't worry.

00:20:40.944 --> 00:20:45.284
The countdown to area termination
can be seen in your sub window.

00:20:45.984 --> 00:20:48.244
Users who are in this area...

00:20:48.324 --> 00:20:50.084
Let's get back to town.

00:20:50.224 --> 00:20:52.554
If the area disappears,
it could be trouble...

00:20:52.624 --> 00:20:53.594
No!

00:20:54.464 --> 00:20:55.444
Because...

00:20:55.524 --> 00:20:57.964
...Haseo's still in there!

00:21:03.464 --> 00:21:04.524
Tabby!

00:21:07.134 --> 00:21:09.664
Two minutes to area termination.

00:21:09.904 --> 00:21:12.344
Users in this area...

00:21:12.414 --> 00:21:13.904
...immediately take
the nearest platform...

00:21:13.974 --> 00:21:16.034
- Tabby!
...and return to town.

00:21:16.114 --> 00:21:17.634
We can't stay here.

00:21:18.184 --> 00:21:19.154
But...

00:21:38.434 --> 00:21:39.694
Haseo.

00:22:15.704 --> 00:22:16.674
Pi.

00:22:16.774 --> 00:22:17.704
Yes?

00:22:17.774 --> 00:22:19.434
There's no doubt now.

00:22:20.814 --> 00:22:23.004
He possesses the factor.

00:22:30.084 --> 00:22:33.684
Ikiru wa dokuhai kiyu no kurushimi wo
Life is a poisoned cup of needless suffering

00:22:33.754 --> 00:22:37.194
Nomihosu sube wo dare ga sazukeyo
That no one can show me how to drain

00:22:37.464 --> 00:22:40.864
Taiyo ni sumu toiu kenja no washi
A wise eagle is said to live in the sun

00:22:40.934 --> 00:22:45.304
Habataki dake ga kodama suru
The flapping of its wings
is all that echoes

00:22:48.704 --> 00:22:52.264
Kono futatsu no me ni yadotta
In each of these eyes

00:22:52.344 --> 00:22:56.044
Yami to Hikari sono docchi de
Dwell darkness and light

00:22:56.114 --> 00:23:03.384
Boku wa ashita wo mitsumeru
beki nano darou
Through which shall I look to tomorrow?

00:23:03.454 --> 00:23:07.084
Kawaki kitta gareki no machi
A dried out and ruined city

00:23:07.154 --> 00:23:10.854
Ten to sen wo tsunagi awase
Draws the lines between the dots

00:23:10.934 --> 00:23:17.854
Imi nado nai koto bakari afurete iku
Causing meaningless events to overflow

00:23:18.034 --> 00:23:21.704
Honou no gotoki kodoku
Soothing the loneliness

00:23:21.774 --> 00:23:24.804
Idaku karada shizumete wa
That flames up within the body

00:23:24.874 --> 00:23:32.474
Ankyo eto shitatatte iku shizuku
Droplets of water fall towards the culvert

00:23:32.714 --> 00:23:36.214
Kakageru dokuhai kono sei wa michitemo
Even if the poisoned cup is upheld
and filled with this life

00:23:36.324 --> 00:23:40.014
Kogareru shino yume wa nagare tsuku
My dream that yearns for death
drifts into it

00:23:40.224 --> 00:23:43.664
Toride ni kuikomu tsume kokou no washi
The eagle remains aloof;
its talons dig into the fort

00:23:43.724 --> 00:23:47.294
Habataki dake ga maiagaru
Only the flapping of its wings resounds

00:23:47.364 --> 00:23:51.094
Ano soukyu ni takkei ni shite kure tamae
Let me be crucified in the blue sky

00:23:51.174 --> 00:23:54.534
Ten to chi ga musubu basho ni
bokuwa tatsu
I'll stand where heaven and earth meet

00:23:56.144 --> 00:23:57.404
Next Episode
